WEBVTT

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.040
(romantic song playing)

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.880
You make a wish

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:19.640
You cast a spell You hope

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.000
An angel rings a bell

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.400
You find yourself

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.240
Still in love with love

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:36.960
You pull the petals from the stem

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.520
You pray that you'll be her and him

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.280
You hope for some sweet message

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.560
From above

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.320
How did you come down from heaven?

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.360
I'm glad that you
came down from heaven

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.480
Did you tumble down?

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:08.040
Did you hit the ground real hard?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.920
How did you get here, my dear?

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:19.000
It isn't very clear, my dear

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:25.760
When your hand meets mine
It is so divine, my dear

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:31.800
Love can heal the sting of pain

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.520
Purify just like the rain

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.040
Wash your tears away

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.040
And dry them in the sun

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:50.480
How did you get here, my dear?

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.680
It isn't very clear, my dear

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.840
But when your lips meet mine

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.240
It is so divine

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:05.560
And I'm in heaven

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.400
Mm

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.120
Yes, I'm in heaven

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:23.280
Mm, yes, I'm in heaven

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:31.240
(instrumental music playing)

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.760
(ethereal music playing)

